# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and fill in. Anything starting with VITE_ is bundled into the browser build, so never put a secret here.
# The AI concierge's model key is NOT set here: it lives on the server (dotnet user-secrets set "Concierge:ApiKey" "<key>", see server/README.md).
# Without it, or in mock mode, a built-in helper answers.

# Phase 12: sign in against the real API. Leave empty to use the in-browser mock and the demo persona picker.
# In development use /api/v1 (the Vite dev server proxies it to the API); set VITE_API_PROXY if the API is not on http://localhost:5182.
VITE_API_URL=
VITE_API_PROXY=
